# La contraseña de prueba no se versiona: se lee de la variable de entorno SEED_PASSWORD
# (definila en tu sistema antes de abrir VS Code, con al menos 12 caracteres).
@password = {{$processEnv SEED_PASSWORD}}

### GET ALL Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients

### POST Crear un Cliente
# @name createClient
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cliente",
  "lastName": "Prueba",
  "phone": "0000000000",
  "username": "cliente_prueba",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "email": "cliente.prueba@example.com"
}

### ID del Cliente creado
@id = {{createClient.response.body.data.id}}

### GET Un Cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/{{id}}

### PATCH Actualizar un Cliente
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/clients/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cliente Actualizado",
  "lastName": "Prueba Actualizado",
}

### DELETE Eliminar un Cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/clients/{{id}}
